    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#measure_quantity_sold"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#Measure"/><rdfs:label>Quantity Sold</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Number of units, licenses, or subscriptions included in the booking transaction.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:sourceTable>QuoteToBooking.fact_bookings</ex:sourceTable><ex:sourceColumn>quantity</ex:sourceColumn><ex:semanticDefinition>Number of units, licenses, or subscriptions included in the booking transaction.</ex:semanticDefinition><ex:aggregationType>SUM</ex:aggregationType></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#measure_unit_list_price_usd"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#Measure"/><rdfs:label>Unit List Price USD</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Standard list price per unit in U.S. dollars before discounts are applied.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:sourceTable>QuoteToBooking.fact_bookings</ex:sourceTable><ex:sourceColumn>unit_list_price_usd</ex:sourceColumn><ex:semanticDefinition>Standard list price per unit in U.S. dollars before discounts are applied.</ex:semanticDefinition><ex:aggregationType>SUM</ex:aggregationType></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#measure_discount_percentage"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#Measure"/><rdfs:label>Discount Percentage</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Percentage discount applied to the list price for the booking transaction.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:sourceTable>QuoteToBooking.fact_bookings</ex:sourceTable><ex:sourceColumn>discount_pct</ex:sourceColumn><ex:semanticDefinition>Percentage discount applied to the list price for the booking transaction.</ex:semanticDefinition><ex:aggregationType>AVG</ex:aggregationType></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#measure_booking_amount_usd"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#Measure"/><rdfs:label>Booking Amount USD</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Total booked revenue amount for the transaction in U.S. dollars after pricing adjustments.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:sourceTable>QuoteToBooking.fact_bookings</ex:sourceTable><ex:sourceColumn>booking_amount_usd</ex:sourceColumn><ex:semanticDefinition>Total booked revenue amount for the transaction in U.S. dollars after pricing adjustments.</ex:semanticDefinition><ex:aggregationType>SUM</ex:aggregationType></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#measure_acv_usd"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#Measure"/><rdfs:label>Annual Contract Value USD</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Annualized value of the contract associated with the booking in U.S. dollars.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:sourceTable>QuoteToBooking.fact_bookings</ex:sourceTable><ex:sourceColumn>acv_usd</ex:sourceColumn><ex:semanticDefinition>Annualized value of the contract associated with the booking in U.S. dollars.</ex:semanticDefinition><ex:aggregationType>SUM</ex:aggregationType></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#measure_tcv_usd"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#Measure"/><rdfs:label>Total Contract Value USD</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Total value of the full contract associated with the booking in U.S. dollars.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:sourceTable>QuoteToBooking.fact_bookings</ex:sourceTable><ex:sourceColumn>tcv_usd</ex:sourceColumn><ex:semanticDefinition>Total value of the full contract associated with the booking in U.S. dollars.</ex:semanticDefinition><ex:aggregationType>SUM</ex:aggregationType></owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- Metadata individuals: Business Rules -->
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#rule_new_booking"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#BusinessRule"/><rdfs:label>New Booking</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>A booking transaction may be classified as a new sale when booking type indicates a new sale.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Derived from the semantic definition of booking type as indicating whether the booking is a new sale or a renewal.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#rule_renewal_booking"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#BusinessRule"/><rdfs:label>Renewal Booking</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>A booking transaction may be classified as a renewal when booking type or renewal indicator denotes renewal.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Derived from the semantic definitions of booking type and renewal indicator.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#rule_booking_links_to_dimensions"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#BusinessRule"/><rdfs:label>Booking Links to Dimensions</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Each booking transaction is semantically linked to customer, product, date, and optionally partner, geography, sales representative, and contract dimensions through foreign key relationships.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Derived from the relationship section of the OSI Semantic Model.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>

    <!-- Metadata individuals: Glossary Terms -->
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_contract"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Contract</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores the business attributes of commercial agreements associated with bookings, including contract type, term, renewal behavior, and support coverage level.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Contract</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Stores the business attributes of commercial agreements associated with bookings, including contract type, term, renewal behavior, and support coverage level.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_customer"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Customer</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores descriptive information about customers that place orders and generate bookings, including segment, industry, account tier, and headquarters location.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Customer</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Stores descriptive information about customers that place orders and generate bookings, including segment, industry, account tier, and headquarters location.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_date"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Date</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores calendar and fiscal date attributes used to analyze bookings over time.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Date</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Stores calendar and fiscal date attributes used to analyze bookings over time.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_geography"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Geography</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores geographic attributes used to analyze bookings by sales region, theater, and country.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Geography</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Stores geographic attributes used to analyze bookings by sales region, theater, and country.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_partner"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Partner</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores information about channel and direct partners involved in the sales process, including partner type, partner tier, and route to market.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Partner</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Stores information about channel and direct partners involved in the sales process, including partner type, partner tier, and route to market.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_product"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Product</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores descriptive information about products and offers sold to customers, including product family, technology domain, offer type, and business entity.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Product</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Stores descriptive information about products and offers sold to customers, including product family, technology domain, offer type, and business entity.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_sales_representative"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Sales Representative</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores information about sales personnel responsible for managing customer relationships and booking transactions.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Sales Representative</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Stores information about sales personnel responsible for managing customer relationships and booking transactions.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_booking_transaction"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Booking Transaction</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Stores individual completed sales booking transactions with related financial measures and links to customer, product, partner, geography, sales representative, contract, and date dimensions.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Booking Transaction</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Stores individual completed sales booking transactions with related financial measures and links to customer, product, partner, geography, sales representative, contract, and date dimensions.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#glossary_technology_domain"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://example.com/ontology/enterprise-sales-bookings#GlossaryTerm"/><rdfs:label>Technology Domain</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment>Technology area or solution domain to which the product belongs.</rdfs:comment><ex:sourceEntity>Product</ex:sourceEntity><ex:semanticDefinition>Technology area or solution domain to which the product belongs.</ex:semanticDefinition></owl:NamedIndividual>

